rd on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025 that pair hit 72% on the middle of the grids, and January to February hit 67%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 51% and March to April at 212% on the middle of the grids. Grid 26879 had its driest year in 1963, at 65% of normal.</p>"}
